  "task_scope": "正式语料连续窗口盲抽取；事件数量和边界未知。",
  "source_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0074",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 74,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0074",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：24：08"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0075",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 75,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0075",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：日本人是小饼干，阎锡山是大饼子。这个大饼子还是合我们的口味，它有点咸有点甜，比这个（杨永松指右手食指）稍薄一点，很解决问题。就给我们一个人发了十个，其他东西什么也没补充。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0076",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 76,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0076",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：咱们缴获的有没有子弹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0077",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 77,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0077",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：咱们缴获了一部分啊。（但）当时部队没有到（弹药）堆栈那里去，部队还在作战，在那边。686团不知道补充了没有，他离得比较近。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0078",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 78,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0078",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：25：03"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0079",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 79,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0079",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：缴获的这些当时还没有补充到部队上？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0080",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 80,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0080",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：他不是摆到那个公路上堆在那里嘛，你要说你这个团指挥员不知道那个情况，他怎么到那里拿去？！师部那个时候，他呀，后方的没有一个到前面去的。就是第三天往外撤下来的时候，林彪、聂荣臻……大概还有个什么参谋长之类的人，带了不到一百人，什么警卫排、通信排、电话排呀，就他这很简单的一个指挥机关，他是不是有人去查了？我就不知道了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0081",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 81,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0081",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：26：00"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0082",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 82,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0082",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：所以平型关我们部队弄到的东西都是当时现场搞到的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0083",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 83,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0083",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：就现场能得到多少就有多少，事后补充是不大可能的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0084",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 84,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0084",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：对，因为那个地方有，你也不知道，不知道686团他离得比较近，补充了什么东西没有。可能那门炮到底谁弄下来（不知道），它汽车上放着，我听说有一门这么长的，这么大的轮子，这么高一点的（炮）。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0085",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 85,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0085",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这个七五口径炮是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0086",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 86,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0086",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：可是686团我们东进的时候他有一门，就那个小炮。我在山东，我们跟686团分在一块的时候，我也看见那门炮，一个雨布盖着呢（杨永松笑）。是不是那个我就不知道了，所以那门炮反正我们685团没有弄到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0087",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 87,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0087",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：27：06"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0088",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 88,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0088",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：您老提到陈光说部队弹药和人员都没有得到补充，他什么意见？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0089",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 89,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0089",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：我这个上面写了，陈光就讲，中央给我们的任务，打运动游击战，不放弃有利条件的运动战，交给我们的任务是要在敌后建立根据地，扩大我们人民自己的军队。可是现在呢，要我们上忻口去作战，忻口是十几二十万中央军！还有阎锡山的部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0090",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 90,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0090",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：28：02"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0091",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 91,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0091",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：我们离那里比较近，炮啊响得“咚咚”的，离得是比较近。他的意思是说我们没有得到补充，江西长征出来的都是老骨头硬骨头，我们把这硬骨头打了，你一上去不就……本来人就已经不多了，你再打一家伙就没有多少了。我们怎么样去建立根据地，怎么样去作为抗日的主力军宣传、组织群众？他有这么个讲话，那个会我参加了，我记忆多少大概就是这么一些，可能讲了有不到一个钟头的话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0092",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 92,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0092",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：29：05"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0093",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 93,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0093",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：就是在这个时候呢，陈光他跟上面的这个思想，要我们执行忻口作战任务的，很明显就有抵触了。意思说忻口那么多人，他那么多武器，敌人那个方向也是一个师团，从雁门关进来的。他一个师团最多嘛万把人，二三十万人打他，那么多武器，炮兵多少团在那边，我们去顶什么用？这么几百人啊，两个团合起来千把人，上战场嘛最多不到一千人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0094",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 94,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0094",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：30：00"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0095",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 95,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0095",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：而且打光了这些都是革命的老底子啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0096",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 96,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0096",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：你打光了以后怎么样去执行以后的任务？他这个讲话呢，对我们连以上干部的人的思想啊就宽广起来了，就说我们不是光是逞目前一时之勇，我已经打到平型关的战斗胜利，已经在全国有比较大的影响了。我们是应该要得到补充，然后才能继续作战。不能把这老骨头都打光了，拿什么本钱去做生意啊。（杨永松笑）"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0097",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 97,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0097",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：30：48"
    }
  ]
}
